# Homelab hosts. SSH between desktop, xps16, and pve goes over Tailscale SSH
# (`tailscale set --ssh` on each), authenticated by tailnet identity, so no
# keys are needed and this works from anywhere. MagicDNS resolves `desktop`
# and `xps16` with no entry here; pve needs one for the root user and because
# the bare name `pve` also exists in AdGuard as the LAN address.
# LAN fallback with the key if Tailscale is down: ssh root@192.168.86.10
Host pve
  HostName 100.97.98.121
  User root
